    "alert_id": "P005_TDF_MONITORING_GAP",
    "title": "Missing TDF renal monitoring in plan",
    "message": "Guidelines specify serum creatinine and eGFR monitoring for patients on TDF-based ART. The patient's latest eGFR is 52 mL/min/1.73m² with a confirmed progressive decline over 6 years. The clinician's assessment and plan section is blank, with no documented orders for repeat renal function tests, urinalysis follow-up, or renal safety assessment. This represents a monitoring gap given the existing renal impairment trajectory.",
    "issue_type": "monitoring_gap",
    "severity": "moderate",
    "recommended_action": "Order repeat serum creatinine, eGFR, and urinalysis. Document a renal monitoring plan and consider nephrology referral if decline continues.",
